<title>USA: N.Y. firm cuts Raytech stake.</title>
<headline>N.Y. firm cuts Raytech stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albert Fried &amp; Co LLC said Wednesday it reduced its stake in Raytech Corp to 5.82 percent or 188,100 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the New York-based broker-dealer said it sold 67,800 shares of Raytech between November 12 and January 3 at prices ranging from $4.00 to $4.50 a share.</p>
